@startuml Day-2-Day Architecture

title Day-2-Day Calendar Application Architecture

package "Frontend" as FE {
    [HTML Templates] as Templates
    [CSS Styles] as CSS
    [JavaScript] as JS
}

note right of FE
    User interface layer
    - HTML Templates: Jinja2 templates for rendering web pages
    - CSS Styles: Styling for calendar grid and overall UI
    - JavaScript: Client-side logic for calendar interactions
end note

package "Backend" as BE {
    package "Routes" as Routes {
        [Main Routes] as MainRoutes
        [Notes Routes] as NotesRoutes
        [Task Routes] as TaskRoutes
    }

    note right of Routes
        Web route handlers
        - Main Routes: Home page, calendar view
        - Notes Routes: CRUD operations for notes
        - Task Routes: Task management endpoints
    end note

    package "API" as API {
        [Admin API] as AdminAPI
        [Profile API] as ProfileAPI
        [Assignments API] as AssignmentsAPI
        [Courses API] as CoursesAPI
        [Users API] as UsersAPI
        [Hello API] as HelloAPI
    }

    note right of API
        REST API endpoints
        - Admin API: User management, system admin functions
        - Profile API: User profile operations
        - Assignments API: Canvas assignment synchronization
        - Courses API: Course information retrieval
        - Users API: User authentication and data
        - Hello API: Basic health check endpoint
    end note

    package "Logic" as Logic {
        [Admin Service] as AdminService
        [Profile Service] as ProfileService
        [Note Manager] as NoteManager
        [Notifications] as Notifications
        [Email Notifications] as EmailNotifications
        [Task Filter] as TaskFilter
    }

    note right of Logic
        Business logic layer
        - Admin Service: User and profile administration
        - Profile Service: Profile management operations
        - Note Manager: Note creation, editing, organization
        - Notifications: In-app notification system
        - Email Notifications: Automated email reminders
        - Task Filter: Task sorting and filtering logic
    end note

    package "Data" as Data {
        [Database] as DB
        [User Repository] as UserRepo
        [Profile Repository] as ProfileRepo
        [Note Repository] as NoteRepo
    }

    note right of Data
        Data persistence layer
        - Database: SQLite/PostgreSQL data storage
        - User Repository: User data access patterns
        - Profile Repository: Profile data operations
        - Note Repository: Note storage and retrieval
    end note

    package "Canvas Integration" as Canvas {
        [Canvas Client] as CanvasClient
    }

    note right of Canvas
        External LMS integration
        - Canvas Client: API client for Canvas LMS
        Fetches assignments, courses, and user data
    end note

    package "Utils" as Utils {
        [Auth] as Auth
        [Validators] as Validators
        [Date Utils] as DateUtils
    }

    note right of Utils
        Utility functions
        - Auth: Authentication and authorization helpers
        - Validators: Input validation and sanitization
        - Date Utils: Date parsing and manipulation
    end note
}

package "External Services" as External {
    [Canvas LMS API] as CanvasAPI
    [Email Service] as EmailService
}

note right of External
    Third-party integrations
    - Canvas LMS API: Educational platform API
    - Email Service: SMTP or service for notifications
end note

' Relationships
FE --> BE : HTTP Requests
MainRoutes --> Templates : Renders
NotesRoutes --> NoteManager : Uses
TaskRoutes --> TaskFilter : Uses

AdminAPI --> AdminService : Uses
ProfileAPI --> ProfileService : Uses
AssignmentsAPI --> CanvasClient : Uses
CoursesAPI --> CanvasClient : Uses

AdminService --> UserRepo : Accesses
AdminService --> ProfileRepo : Accesses
ProfileService --> ProfileRepo : Accesses
NoteManager --> NoteRepo : Accesses

UserRepo --> DB : Persists
ProfileRepo --> DB : Persists
NoteRepo --> DB : Persists

CanvasClient --> CanvasAPI : Calls
EmailNotifications --> EmailService : Sends

' Future Architecture (dashed lines)
package "Future Enhancements" as Future {
    [Mobile App] as Mobile
    [Advanced Analytics] as Analytics
    [Cloud Storage] as Cloud
}

note right of Future
    Planned enhancements
    - Mobile App: Native mobile application
    - Advanced Analytics: Data insights and reporting
    - Cloud Storage: Backup and multi-device sync
end note

Mobile -.-> BE : API Access
Analytics -.-> Data : Data Analysis
Cloud -.-> Data : Backup/Sync

@enduml